  "locale:72745 [quest_dialog | - | Sampson Idlefist] \"We have to prove <font color='#D9781A'>Sampson Idlefist</font> is a fraud so that we can reclaim our brawler pride!<BR><BR>We'll need to <font color='#D9781A'>g\"",
