  "locale:72748 [quest_dialog | - | Fraudulent Brawler] \"Ah, you're back. So you have decided to work for me? Excellent.\"",
  "locale:72751 [quest_objective | - | Fraudulent Brawler] 'Speak to Sampson Idlefist and gain his trust.'",
