  "locale:72757 [quest_dialog | - | Fraudulent Brawler] \"Please hurry and try to gain Sampson Idlefist's trust. I am tired of being on ice troll duty and we need to clear our good names!\"",
  "locale:72759 [quest_dialog | - | Sampson Idlefist] \"So you're looking for work? I can help as long as you're not one of those goody goodies who's afraid to get their hands dirty. <BR><BR>If you can keep your mout\"",
  "locale:72761 [quest_dialog | - | Sampson Idlefist] \"I offered my &quot;protection&quot; to a bunch of people, but they haven't paid me yet. It's not wise to mess with the toughest brawler around!<BR><BR><font col\""
